sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Learner
    participant p1 as Browser Stage
    participant p2 as Lesson Assets
    participant p3 as Progress API
    participant p4 as Progress DB
    participant p5 as Analytics
    p0->>p1: Next animation step
    p1->>p2: Load declarative scene locally
    p1->>p0: Render without server roundtrip
    p1->>p3: Save completed lesson milestone
    p3->>p4: Upsert user progress
    p3->>p5: Aggregated analytics event
